The driver source in this tree is MIT licensed: see COPYING.MIT and the
SPDX headers on the files. COPYING.LGPL retains the GNU Lesser General Public
License Version 2.1 text from the upstream libva-v4l2 project, whose LGPL
tiled-YUV sources are no longer part of this tree. It is kept for provenance;
it does not license the current driver source.

Package metadata keeps MIT AND LGPL-2.1-or-later so distributions that
attribute the upstream history remain conservative. Both licence texts and
this file are installed under /usr/share/licenses by the Fedora and Arch
packages.
